WEBVTT

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:09.480
So bright!

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:10.800
So bright...

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.690
It's so sparkly!

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:15.200
So why did we come to the beach so suddenly?

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.210
Is there an ocean scene you're 
going to draw in your manga?

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:20.420
Nope!

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:22.160
Then why?

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:27.430
Because it's summer!

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:30.010
<i>So bright!</i>

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:50.320
Comic Girls

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:04.770
I haven't been to the beach in forever.

00:02:04.780 --> 00:02:06.160
Neither have I! I'm so excited!

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:08.890
I'm going to fall!

00:02:12.850 --> 00:02:15.250
I'm done changing!

00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:22.450
I got a new swimsuit. What do you think?

00:02:23.060 --> 00:02:24.480
<i>Her body's bright, too.</i>

00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:26.090
<i>She's being noticed by everyone...</i>

00:02:26.090 --> 00:02:27.240
<i>And...</i>

00:02:29.020 --> 00:02:31.330
Does this color not look good on me?

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:32.370
It does!

00:02:32.370 --> 00:02:33.470
So don't lift them up.

00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:34.500
Really?

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:37.850
Why aren't you changing?

00:02:37.850 --> 00:02:39.640
Why? Um...

00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:41.590
We didn't bring swimsuits...

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:42.630
What?

00:02:42.630 --> 00:02:44.480
But why? We're at the beach!

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:46.610
Well...

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:50.560
It basically never crossed my mind...

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:56.350
Jeez. Let's go to a rental shop, then.

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:58.740
Rental Shop

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:58.740
Part-timers
wanted

00:02:56.350 --> 00:02:58.020
There's one right over there.

00:03:02.590 --> 00:03:04.530
Kaos-chan, are you done changing?

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:06.820
Y-Yes.

00:03:07.710 --> 00:03:09.890
So cute!

00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:12.950
Um...

00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:13.750
Yes?

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:17.800
It wouldn't be good if my tummy got 
cold, so can I wear a haramaki?

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:19.970
You look really lame, so please don't!

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:20.930
I'm ready.

00:03:23.060 --> 00:03:26.050
Your body is so lean and pretty.

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:29.080
You don't have any fat on you,

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:31.890
like around your tummy or around there...

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:35.360
I'm sorry for staring!

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:37.700
This is my rectus abdominis muscle!

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:39.440
And these are my obliques!

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:40.980
Make sure you study anatomy properly!

00:03:40.980 --> 00:03:41.500
Yes, ma'am!

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:42.690
<i>S-So strict...</i>

00:03:42.690 --> 00:03:44.810
Okay, Ruki-chan is next.

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:46.760
Th-That's okay.

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:48.280
I'll just watch all of you swim.

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:48.850
And—

00:03:48.850 --> 00:03:50.660
We picked one out earlier.

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:52.590
It won't be any fun unless 
we all go swimming.

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:00.070
Is she done yet?

00:04:00.070 --> 00:04:01.450
She's taking a while...

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:03.380
Did she... actually run away?

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:04.610
No way.

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:07.360
Ruki-chan!

00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:08.680
No!

00:04:10.340 --> 00:04:12.180
So bright!

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:14.560
Rukki, did you get a little bigger?

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:16.210
Wait, really?

00:04:16.210 --> 00:04:17.460
Yeah, your height.

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:19.440
Why are you talking about 
my height right now?!

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:23.860
Yay! The ocean!

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:26.360
So cold!

00:04:29.460 --> 00:04:31.620
What are you doing, guys?

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:34.300
I could probably use those cliffs 
over there for a battle scene!

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:36.240
There are so many couples in swimsuits.

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:37.590
Wow I'm getting a front row seat.

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:39.460
You guys need to look at the ocean!

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:40.970
Let's go, Kaos-chan!

00:04:40.970 --> 00:04:43.730
I nearly drowned before, 
so I'm scared of the ocean!

00:04:43.730 --> 00:04:45.160
I can't!

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:48.240
What? You guys aren't going to play?

00:04:54.710 --> 00:04:56.500
I guess not...

00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:00.150
Koyume-chan...

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:03.900
Ten Minutes Later.

00:05:04.440 --> 00:05:07.160
<i>I wonder where Koyume-chan went...</i>

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:13.740
She made friends!

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:16.050
Koyume is pretty amazing.

00:05:16.050 --> 00:05:19.300
I thought manga artists
were all introverts.

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:20.750
And she's really cheerful.

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:23.120
She has this aura that draws people in.

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:24.710
Koyume-chan...

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:27.520
What?

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:31.460
Kaos has somehow attracted some crabs.

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:33.560
Are they resonating together 
because they're all small?

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:37.060
Koyume-chan is hanging out 
with people we don't know...

00:05:37.760 --> 00:05:40.570
My chest feels all tingly...

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:43.070
Koyume-chan, I changed my mind!
I want to play with y—

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:44.890
Sand! Hot!

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:48.130
You need to calm down, Kaos-chan.

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:54.100
Let's get you used to the water first.

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:56.750
It's not scary if we're holding hands, right?

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:57.460
It's not.

00:05:58.640 --> 00:06:02.080
I have way more fun with you, Kaos-chan.

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:03.620
Fun...

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:05.800
<i>My chest is pounding.</i>

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:08.790
<i>It feels like there's electricity flowing 
through my body and it's going numb.</i>

00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:10.840
<i>Could this be...</i>

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:15.600
A man o' war...

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:15.600
Kaos-chan!

00:06:18.180 --> 00:06:20.130
They look like they're having fun.

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:22.760
Should we go?

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:25.990
I feel like I want to sketch 
a little longer, but...

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:27.990
Hey!

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:34.910
Hey!

00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:38.600
It's so cold!

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:40.050
You'll get used to it.

00:06:40.050 --> 00:06:40.580
Here.

00:06:41.090 --> 00:06:42.010
Hup.

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:52.410
It's okay, Ruki-san!

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:55.090
You're still the most 
beautiful mermaid to me!

00:06:55.360 --> 00:06:56.900
Don't let it get to you so much, Rukki.

00:06:56.900 --> 00:06:57.970
Yeah.

00:06:57.970 --> 00:06:59.480
You look really good in that swimsuit.

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:01.570
Ugh! Don't surround me like that!

00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:04.280
You're way too concerned about that.

00:07:04.280 --> 00:07:08.490
<i>The beach, swimsuits, the world of girls...</i>

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:09.260
<i>So cute...</i>

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:09.970
Kaos-chan!

00:07:09.970 --> 00:07:10.790
Hurgh.

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:13.840
<i>It hurts... but I'm so happy...</i>

00:07:13.840 --> 00:07:15.580
Kaos-chan!

00:07:16.090 --> 00:07:18.800
Head towards America!

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:23.500
That's your biceps brachii muscle.

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:36.560
It's been so long since 
I moved around this much.

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:37.300
Me, too.

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:39.350
It's been such a long time since I've 
had fun playing around like this.

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:41.080
Right?

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:44.880
I don't want to ever forget 
this view from today.

00:07:46.870 --> 00:07:50.470
The blue sky, the white clouds...

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:51.760
And...

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:55.580
Rukki's sketchbook being 
washed away by the waves.

00:07:57.030 --> 00:08:00.500
So what made you want to come 
to the beach all of a sudden?

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:01.310
Huh?

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:04.530
Well, because it's summer!

00:08:04.530 --> 00:08:06.020
There's still a lot more to do!

00:08:06.020 --> 00:08:08.380
Like going to see fireworks, going to the 
pool, and to an amusement park!

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:09.750
Um, sorry.

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:11.250
I don't have any more energy...

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:12.470
We won't last.

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:15.170
Aw, come on! Let's go!

00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:18.400
My sketchbook!

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:23.520
You were saying how you didn't 
want to forget that view,

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:25.610
but this is the first thing 
you do when we get back?

00:08:25.610 --> 00:08:28.490
Isn't it a bit dark in here?

00:08:28.490 --> 00:08:30.650
It's hard to see the screen 
when it's too bright.

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:34.530
Koyume-chan and Ruki-san went shopping.

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:36.860
I'm not really interested in clothes.

00:08:36.860 --> 00:08:40.130
Tsu-chan, are you sure you don't 
want to go buy some fall clothes?

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:42.030
Just buy whatever for me.

00:08:42.980 --> 00:08:45.310
You should've gone with them 
if you wanted to go.

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:48.250
But they said they were going 
to Harajuku and Shibuya...

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:50.960
I could never go to Shibuya or Harajuku!

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:52.610
I'll only go to Nakano or Akihabara!

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:54.260
I don't want to ride anything 
other than the Sobu Line!

00:08:54.730 --> 00:08:57.340
You don't really back down, huh?

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:04.350
It looks like they sent us 
a bunch of glamour shots.

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:05.300
They're such girls...

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:07.880
They're asking us which outfit looks better.

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:12.810
Hey, they replied.

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:15.040
They said the sailor outfit 
in the first picture.

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:15.850
Really?

00:09:15.850 --> 00:09:16.690
Yup.

00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:19.990
"Because the vibrant green 
probably won't show up in print."

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:22.960
Of course it wound up manga related.

00:09:24.610 --> 00:09:26.610
Maybe I will go with this.

00:09:26.610 --> 00:09:29.420
Yeah, they said they liked that one, too.

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:30.230
Okay!

00:09:30.230 --> 00:09:32.310
Ruki-chan, you should buy a matching one!

00:09:32.310 --> 00:09:34.480
I don't look good in these things.

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:35.260
What?

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:36.770
Although...

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:40.690
I get all excited when you're 
stripping off sailor outfits.

00:09:39.790 --> 00:09:42.020
M-Miss?!

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:45.490
Thank you very much!

00:09:45.490 --> 00:09:47.530
Yay, bought!

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:49.480
You seem happy.

00:09:50.430 --> 00:09:53.180
It's so much fun shopping 
with you, Koyume-chan.

00:09:53.180 --> 00:09:54.290
Really?

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:57.020
Well, Tsu-chan's not interested 
in fashion at all.

00:09:57.020 --> 00:09:57.950
I know!

00:09:57.950 --> 00:09:59.300
Why don't we get some pasta somewhere?

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:00.470
Heck yeah!

00:10:00.470 --> 00:10:02.030
I'll let those two know, then.

00:10:02.880 --> 00:10:04.960
Apparently they're going 
to go eat pasta somewhere.

00:10:04.960 --> 00:10:05.750
I see.

00:10:07.240 --> 00:10:10.600
Ruki-san would probably yell 
at us if she saw our meal.

00:10:10.600 --> 00:10:12.670
We can eat these once in a while.

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:17.090
This looks so good!

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:19.410
Koyume-chan, did you get the carbonara?

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:21.620
Yup! Want to share later?

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:23.000
Yeah!

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:25.630
Pardon me, could we get another straw?

00:10:25.630 --> 00:10:26.600
Sure.

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:33.140
So bold...

00:10:33.140 --> 00:10:34.730
Yeah...

00:10:34.990 --> 00:10:36.160
What's the matter?

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:39.940
Maybe shojo manga artists really can't draw 
shojo manga without relationship experience...

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:42.630
Did your editor say something to you again?

00:10:42.630 --> 00:10:43.470
Yeah...

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:46.380
She said that I could maybe do a one-off,

00:10:46.380 --> 00:10:49.200
but I lack the experience to 
do a serialized series.

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:51.060
That's not true!

00:10:51.060 --> 00:10:55.000
If you get better at using your imagination, you
could draw great manga and even get serialized.

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:59.220
I mean, look at me! 
I barely, I mean, hardly...

00:10:59.710 --> 00:11:01.680
Actually I have no experience whatsoever.

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:02.640
I-I'm so sorry!

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:05.050
Uh, it's nothing to apologize about...

00:11:05.050 --> 00:11:06.270
But what a surprise!

00:11:06.270 --> 00:11:08.960
It seems like you'd get a lot 
of people asking you out.

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:13.560
No one's ever asked me, and even if I had a boyfriend,

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:17.020
I could never go on dates with him looking all 
ragged from working all night the day before.

00:11:17.020 --> 00:11:19.380
I would want to prepare like a week in advance.

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:20.770
You're such a girl!

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:23.330
But then I wouldn't be able 
to work on my manuscripts.

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:29.080
Ramble Ramble Ramble

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:26.590
I'll have to sacrifice sleep time and 
try to recover with hot baths.

00:11:26.590 --> 00:11:29.080
Then I'm probably going to be 
even dizzier during classes...

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:30.500
I'd die...

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:32.800
Maybe relationships aren't 
your thing, Ruki-chan.

00:11:32.800 --> 00:11:34.230
On the other hand,

00:11:34.230 --> 00:11:37.340
you seem like the type to be able to 
draw manga, even if you're in love.

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:40.040
You might even be more powerful 
if you had a boyfriend.

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:42.140
My editor told me that, too.

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:44.130
So is there anyone you like?

00:11:44.130 --> 00:11:44.850
Huh?!

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:50.590
I-I mean, I don't even know any guys.

00:11:50.590 --> 00:11:52.850
Yeah, and I guess Tsu-chan is a girl.

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:55.920
How did you know I was 
thinking about Tsubasa-san?!

00:11:55.920 --> 00:11:58.130
Of course I know! It's totally obvious.

00:11:58.130 --> 00:11:59.970
Don't think I'm weird, okay?

00:11:59.970 --> 00:12:01.910
I don't even really understand it myself.

00:12:01.910 --> 00:12:05.290
I know that Tsubasa-san is a girl,

00:12:05.290 --> 00:12:07.490
but she's cool and really hot.

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:10.620
Not to mention, she's like a prince, 
but can be really innocent and cute.

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:15.450
And when I'm watching Tsubasa-san, 
I can draw all kinds of boys.

00:12:15.450 --> 00:12:17.340
<i>They all look exactly the same, though...</i>

00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:20.240
Well, why don't you try hanging out first? 
Just the two of you.

00:12:20.240 --> 00:12:21.840
Just the two of us?

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:23.590
Why don't you go on a date with her?

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:25.890
D-D-D-D-D...

00:12:26.110 --> 00:12:28.010
A date?!

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:34.020
Episode 5
"Amisawa-san,
Do You Cosplay?"

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:34.020
Wh-What are you...
I couldn't possibly go out 
with Tsubasa-san on a d-date...
I-I could n-never do...

00:12:35.890 --> 00:12:38.020
But Tsubasa-san is a girl!

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:39.230
Going on a date with her is...

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:40.430
It's not weird at all!

00:12:40.430 --> 00:12:43.270
Girls have always asked Tsu-chan out.

00:12:43.270 --> 00:12:45.170
Huh?! And how does she react?

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:46.780
Um, I think...

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:49.950
Um... I'm a big fan of yours.

00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:53.410
<i>But the fact I draw manga is a secret...</i>

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:54.820
How did you find out?!

00:12:54.820 --> 00:12:55.520
Huh?

00:12:55.520 --> 00:12:57.070
Do you have special powers?!

00:12:57.070 --> 00:12:58.450
What's your aim?!

00:12:58.770 --> 00:13:00.820
I don't think their feelings ever got across.

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:02.150
Yeah...

00:13:02.150 --> 00:13:05.180
Well, if I did go somewhere 
with just Tsubasa-san...

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:10.600
Koyume.

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:14.220
Give me your hand 
so we don't get separated.

00:13:14.220 --> 00:13:15.960
O-Okay.

00:13:21.010 --> 00:13:22.770
Something like that...

00:13:22.770 --> 00:13:24.560
Koyume-chan, we're talking about dates...

00:13:24.560 --> 00:13:26.810
<i>You lose.</i>

00:13:26.810 --> 00:13:28.500
<i>Final round.</i>

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:30.530
I haven't won once.

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:33.440
Actually, you're not bad for a girl, Kaos.

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:36.840
But when you're up against me with my evil 
eye which has ultimate kinetic eyesight—

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:41.220
<i>KO! You win!</i>

00:13:41.650 --> 00:13:42.690
I won...

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:44.960
U-Um, that doesn't count.

00:13:44.960 --> 00:13:46.100
Tsubasa-san.

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:46.670
What?

00:13:48.520 --> 00:13:51.490
I thought you had an evil eye.

00:13:51.490 --> 00:13:52.740
Kaos...

00:13:53.210 --> 00:13:54.930
Why, you little—

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:56.060
Get over here!

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:57.040
Stop, stop!

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:01.000
You're playing video games again!

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:01.810
So bright!

00:14:01.810 --> 00:14:02.400
Huh?

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:05.130
Go on.

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:06.280
U-Um...

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:09.120
Um, uh...

00:14:09.120 --> 00:14:11.460
This is too embarrassing!

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:14.720
Oh, my. Whatever shall I do?

00:14:15.920 --> 00:14:19.920
I just happen to have two tickets to the 
amusement park that expire tomorrow.

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:22.380
Yay! I love the amusement park!

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:24.920
Huh?

00:14:34.190 --> 00:14:36.100
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:39.570
I just got a request for an 
illustration, so I can't go.

00:14:39.570 --> 00:14:40.130
Huh?

00:14:40.130 --> 00:14:42.890
I-I also got a sudden 
request for an illustration...

00:14:42.890 --> 00:14:44.210
or not.

00:14:44.210 --> 00:14:46.740
But my manuscript... 
actually doesn't have a due date...

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:49.200
My cold... is actually all better now...

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:51.240
My leg... Yes, my leg hurts...

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:54.530
<i>Somehow, it ended up 
being just the two of us.</i>

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:57.540
Maybe we should start with this...

00:14:57.540 --> 00:15:00.960
<i>I-I don't know what to say to her...</i>

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:02.960
U-Um, sorry? Did you wait long?

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:03.610
Huh?

00:15:03.610 --> 00:15:04.960
But we both came from the dorm, right?

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:07.020
Right...

00:15:08.090 --> 00:15:09.300
I'm so...

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:11.170
...worried.

00:15:13.870 --> 00:15:15.540
I'm so embarrassed...

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:17.570
Here you go. Have something 
sweet, and calm down.

00:15:17.570 --> 00:15:19.200
Th-Thank you very much.

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:20.030
How much do I owe you?

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:21.050
Don't worry about it.

00:15:21.050 --> 00:15:23.440
You never let me pay you 
for being an assistant.

00:15:23.830 --> 00:15:26.950
So today, as compensation, I'll treat you to whatever.

00:15:26.950 --> 00:15:28.560
Is there anything else you want?

00:15:29.690 --> 00:15:31.300
Well?!

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:33.140
Something else?

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:35.360
That thing?

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:38.130
I think I want to take a picture with it.

00:15:38.530 --> 00:15:39.610
Got it.

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:42.630
I'll go take it down!

00:15:44.800 --> 00:15:46.830
Please don't!

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:51.310
<i>Tsubasa-san is so nice!</i>

00:15:51.310 --> 00:15:52.610
Where should we go next?

00:15:52.610 --> 00:15:54.580
I haven't been to an amusement 
park in about ten years,

00:15:54.580 --> 00:15:55.640
so I have no idea.

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:58.100
Oh, then I'll show you around.

00:15:58.100 --> 00:15:59.590
This way!

00:16:03.570 --> 00:16:05.880
It's gradually starting to look like a date.

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:07.270
I wonder where they're going.

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:11.990
Haunted House

00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:10.100
Maybe the haunted house.

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:14.950
Or the coffee cups...

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:16.860
Maybe the Viking ship?

00:16:19.170 --> 00:16:22.900
Um, I think this is it...

00:16:22.900 --> 00:16:24.900
Or were they just lost?

00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:26.580
But isn't this...

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:27.210
The Jet Coaster to Hell

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:30.050
A jet coaster...

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:32.210
Yes! It's a lot of fun!

00:16:36.630 --> 00:16:38.580
So it was actually Tsubasa-chan 
who reacted like that!

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:39.340
Matron?!

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:47.520
That was so scary...

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:49.980
Oh, this is the cosplay area.

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:52.050
Yes, yes, so that's her next move.

00:16:52.050 --> 00:16:55.060
Wasn't the jet coaster 
a lot of fun, Kaos-chan?

00:16:55.060 --> 00:16:58.330
Scary... Jet coaster...

00:16:58.330 --> 00:16:59.570
Kaos-chan?!

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:06.390
Someone's cosplaying as the Dark Hero!

00:17:06.390 --> 00:17:08.170
Let's go have our picture taken!

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:09.250
Excuse me...

00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:17.170
Why are you here?!

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:19.520
Mayu, let's go home.

00:17:19.520 --> 00:17:20.350
I want to disappear.

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:21.110
Huh?

00:17:21.110 --> 00:17:23.150
You're the one who forced 
me to come with you.

00:17:23.150 --> 00:17:25.430
Miharun and Mayu-chan!

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:29.820
Hey, wait!

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:30.860
Amisawa-san?

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:32.270
Ack, Kaos-sensei!

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:34.830
Amisawa-san, do you cosplay?

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:36.490
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:39.480
This is my best gear!

00:17:39.480 --> 00:17:40.740
It is?!

00:17:43.840 --> 00:17:46.200
Sorry that I'm too close.

00:17:46.200 --> 00:17:47.930
You're totally fine.

00:17:47.930 --> 00:17:48.980
A date?

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:50.630
Those two?

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:52.480
Isn't it wonderful to be young?

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:56.800
Coffee

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:54.370
We never had that happen.

00:17:54.370 --> 00:17:55.250
You're too loud.

00:17:55.250 --> 00:17:56.800
We're going to get caught 
if you don't pipe down.

00:17:58.000 --> 00:18:01.520
Are you sure you wanted to 
come here with me today?

00:18:01.520 --> 00:18:02.340
Huh?

00:18:02.340 --> 00:18:06.390
Wouldn't it have been better for your research
if you'd brought your boyfriend instead?

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:08.610
Oh, but I don't have one...

00:18:08.610 --> 00:18:09.440
Why not?

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:11.060
Why not...? I...

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:15.780
You're really cute, so I doubt anyone would 
turn you down if you asked them out.

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:17.730
That's not true...

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:19.620
But it is!

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:21.700
If you actually tried, no one would say no.

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:23.420
Want me to go find someone you could ask?

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:26.080
Please wait!

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:32.040
Um... I know this is for my manga, but...

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:36.000
But I want to keep my first 
love dear to my heart.

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:41.730
Sorry.

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:46.480
Rukki tells me all the time 
that I can be pretty tactless.

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:49.810
That's not true! It's my own fault!

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:52.620
I'm a shojo manga artist,

00:18:52.620 --> 00:18:56.330
but I can't even be clear about my own feelings!

00:18:56.880 --> 00:18:58.530
Your own feelings?

00:18:58.530 --> 00:18:59.720
Yes...

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:02.020
Koyume-chan.

00:19:02.020 --> 00:19:02.960
Is she actually...

00:19:02.960 --> 00:19:05.250
This atmosphere...

00:19:08.050 --> 00:19:09.700
Hey, it's our turn.

00:19:09.700 --> 00:19:11.210
Yay! Let's get on!

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:13.170
They were so close!

00:19:16.370 --> 00:19:17.740
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:19:17.740 --> 00:19:21.230
<i>I-I'm alone with Tsubasa-san 
on a Ferris wheel...</i>

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:21.980
Koyume?

00:19:21.980 --> 00:19:23.140
Y-Yes?!

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:25.280
Is something on your mind?

00:19:25.280 --> 00:19:26.020
Huh?

00:19:26.020 --> 00:19:28.100
I don't mind. You can tell me anything.

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:29.900
Huh? Um...

00:19:29.900 --> 00:19:31.730
<i>What should I do? Should I tell her?</i>

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:34.970
<i>But I don't even know if these 
feelings are actually love...</i>

00:19:34.970 --> 00:19:36.870
<i>Actually, how does liking someone feel?</i>

00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:37.570
<i>What is love?</i>

00:19:37.880 --> 00:19:39.570
Is it about your manga?

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:40.770
My manga?!

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:41.970
Was I wrong?

00:19:41.970 --> 00:19:45.750
Oh, well, there is that, too, but...

00:19:45.750 --> 00:19:46.630
What is it?

00:19:47.110 --> 00:19:51.860
Right, well, I love romance manga and dramas,

00:19:51.860 --> 00:19:54.050
and I have fun drawing them,

00:19:54.050 --> 00:19:55.920
so I'm pretty satisfied
with just drawing them.

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:58.770
But after coming to the dorm,

00:19:58.770 --> 00:20:01.410
watching you and Ruki-chan,

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:05.010
I feel in awe, and you two 
seem so professional...

00:20:05.290 --> 00:20:08.980
Even Kaos-chan doesn't give up. 
She always tries her best.

00:20:10.210 --> 00:20:11.590
So after seeing that,

00:20:11.590 --> 00:20:14.550
I've been wanting to try even harder...

00:20:14.550 --> 00:20:17.460
But then I got told I'm still a long 
ways away from a serialized series.

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:30.340
You just need to keep going 
the way you are, Koyume.

00:20:30.340 --> 00:20:34.800
Being able to have fun while you're 
drawing is what's best about you.

00:20:35.030 --> 00:20:37.180
You don't have to worry 
about catching up to us.

00:20:37.180 --> 00:20:38.780
Tsubasa-san...

00:20:40.610 --> 00:20:43.060
I'll be waiting for you, 
no matter how long it takes.

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:46.170
Okay...

00:20:48.090 --> 00:20:50.210
Was there anything else?

00:20:50.210 --> 00:20:51.800
There isn't!

00:20:54.820 --> 00:20:56.810
Thank you very much.

00:20:56.810 --> 00:21:00.100
But I never thought you'd say 
something like that, Koyume.

00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:03.280
I'm sorry, I just couldn't hold back...

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:05.650
Wait, what happened?!

00:21:05.650 --> 00:21:06.500
Guys?

00:21:06.500 --> 00:21:08.300
Development?! Was there development?!

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:09.150
N...

00:21:09.150 --> 00:21:10.450
No!

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:13.660
She patted me on the head
She patted me on the head

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:12.350
We were just talking about manga!

00:21:12.350 --> 00:21:13.700
But it's written all over your face.

00:21:13.700 --> 00:21:14.410
Huh?!

00:21:15.220 --> 00:21:18.370
We should all research 
romance manga together sometime.

00:21:18.370 --> 00:21:21.410
If you don't mind, I'll go with you to 
do some research again anytime.

00:21:21.410 --> 00:21:23.170
Th-Thank you very much.

00:21:23.570 --> 00:21:27.390
I'll um... sit in the corner 
so I won't get in the way...

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:30.420
Kaos-chan, you need to keep working hard, 
so we can both get our manga serialized together!

00:21:30.420 --> 00:21:33.810
I'll continue cheering you 
all on with yummy food.

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:36.410
Then I'll do my best not 
to get in everyone's way...

00:21:36.390 --> 00:21:38.600
Rumble

00:21:36.410 --> 00:21:38.610
Kaos-sensei...

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:42.320
Please observe how professional your 
friends are being and learn from that!

00:23:07.530 --> 00:23:14.030
Haunted House

00:23:30.300 --> 00:23:31.860
They like kneecaps?

00:23:31.860 --> 00:23:33.570
Do you like them, too?!

00:23:33.570 --> 00:23:34.970
I do!

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:36.600
Kneecaps are the best!

00:23:36.600 --> 00:23:39.740
Next time, "I'll Go Shave All My Hair Off!"

00:23:37.350 --> 00:23:40.020
Next Time

00:23:37.350 --> 00:23:40.020
I'll Go Shave All My Hair Off
